                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "305c4264-28c5-37e4-91e4-4e13e6bbb72f",
                        "entry_id": "895b1161-e3dc-3c1d-971a-e8b96a30ed69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A void act; a defective proceeding or one expressly declared by statute to be a nullity."
